        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM 1 — Top-level confidence-gate tightening makes the deeper per-branch reason strings unreachable for any real Assignment, and this new production-relevant behavior is untested",
          "anchor": "medium-1-top-level-confidence-gate-tightening-makes-the-deeper-per-branch-reason-strings-unreachable-for-any-real-assignment-and-this-new-production-relevant-behavior-is-untested",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-1-top-level-confidence-gate-tightening-makes-the-deeper-per-branch-reason-strings-unreachable-for-any-real-assignment-and-this-new-production-relevant-behavior-is-untested",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b411f3b440c6"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM 2 — `onAdvance` wiring is internally correct but not consumed by its one real caller; loop.mjs keeps its own separate, pre-existing plan.md-verdict derivation, so this requirement changes no observable production behavior yet",
          "anchor": "medium-2-onadvance-wiring-is-internally-correct-but-not-consumed-by-its-one-real-caller-loopmjs-keeps-its-own-separate-pre-existing-planmd-verdict-derivation-so-this-requirement-changes-no-observable-production-behavior-yet",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-2-onadvance-wiring-is-internally-correct-but-not-consumed-by-its-one-real-caller-loopmjs-keeps-its-own-separate-pre-existing-planmd-verdict-derivation-so-this-requirement-changes-no-observable-production-behavior-yet",
          "stableAnchor": "h-366b02e7dfa6"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM 3 — Compound `resultKind && operation` guard: verified genuinely forced by current stamped granularity, but confirms R5's ADR-006 §3 intent (\"replacing `operation === ...` branches\") is only 2/6 realized",
          "anchor": "medium-3-compound-resultkind-operation-guard-verified-genuinely-forced-by-current-stamped-granularity-but-confirms-r5s-adr-006-3-intent-replacing-operation-branches-is-only-26-realized",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-3-compound-resultkind-operation-guard-verified-genuinely-forced-by-current-stamped-granularity-but-confirms-r5s-adr-006-3-intent-replacing-operation-branches-is-only-26-realized",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6c3437d05cf2"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW 1 — `findLatestAssignmentRunResult`'s `resultKind` parameter is more general than its one real call site, and that generality is unsafe if ever reused",
          "anchor": "low-1-findlatestassignmentrunresults-resultkind-parameter-is-more-general-than-its-one-real-call-site-and-that-generality-is-unsafe-if-ever-reused",
          "githubAnchor": "low-1-findlatestassignmentrunresults-resultkind-parameter-is-more-general-than-its-one-real-call-site-and-that-generality-is-unsafe-if-ever-reused",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5bc3c1bc3eb0"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW 2 — `onAdvance`'s `opts.repoRoot ?? opts.cwd` fallback is untested and would resolve the wrong content root if ever exercised",
          "anchor": "low-2-onadvances-optsreporoot-optscwd-fallback-is-untested-and-would-resolve-the-wrong-content-root-if-ever-exercised",
          "githubAnchor": "low-2-onadvances-optsreporoot-optscwd-fallback-is-untested-and-would-resolve-the-wrong-content-root-if-ever-exercised",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6a4214d79cec"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW 3 — `fallbackResultKindForOperation`'s try/catch is unreachable defensive code",
          "anchor": "low-3-fallbackresultkindforoperations-trycatch-is-unreachable-defensive-code",
          "githubAnchor": "low-3-fallbackresultkindforoperations-trycatch-is-unreachable-defensive-code",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e1654ffd3d80"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Verified clean (scrutinized, no finding)",
          "anchor": "verified-clean-scrutinized-no-finding",
          "githubAnchor": "verified-clean-scrutinized-no-finding",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ee441a4b1aa7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Disposition",
