        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM 4 — `interpretAssignmentRunResult` only ever reads a real stamped Assignment on ONE of its three production call sites; the two `chooseStageOperation`-internal cross-pass calls always fall back to fresh re-derivation, discarding the actual persisted Assignment's stamped fields",
          "anchor": "medium-4-interpretassignmentrunresult-only-ever-reads-a-real-stamped-assignment-on-one-of-its-three-production-call-sites-the-two-choosestageoperation-internal-cross-pass-calls-always-fall-back-to-fresh-re-derivation-discarding-the-actual-persisted-assignments-stamped-fields",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-4-interpretassignmentrunresult-only-ever-reads-a-real-stamped-assignment-on-one-of-its-three-production-call-sites-the-two-choosestageoperation-internal-cross-pass-calls-always-fall-back-to-fresh-re-derivation-discarding-the-actual-persisted-assignments-stamped-fields",
