        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH — `DOMAIN_HARNESS_SEAMS` discovery has no per-domain failure isolation: one broken domain harness module breaks module load for `assignment.mjs` and everything that imports it, for every domain, every caller, with zero test coverage of this failure mode",
          "anchor": "high-domainharnessseams-discovery-has-no-per-domain-failure-isolation-one-broken-domain-harness-module-breaks-module-load-for-assignmentmjs-and-everything-that-imports-it-for-every-domain-every-caller-with-zero-test-coverage-of-this-failure-mode",
          "githubAnchor": "high-domainharnessseams-discovery-has-no-per-domain-failure-isolation-one-broken-domain-harness-module-breaks-module-load-for-assignmentmjs-and-everything-that-imports-it-for-every-domain-every-caller-with-zero-test-coverage-of-this-failure-mode",
          "stableAnchor": "h-439e79503db2"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM — a domain that is resolvable (Work has `.stage` + `.domain`/`options.domain`) but has no registered harness module silently skips the entire seam, undocumented anywhere",
          "anchor": "medium-a-domain-that-is-resolvable-work-has-stage-domainoptionsdomain-but-has-no-registered-harness-module-silently-skips-the-entire-seam-undocumented-anywhere",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-a-domain-that-is-resolvable-work-has-stage-domainoptionsdomain-but-has-no-registered-harness-module-silently-skips-the-entire-seam-undocumented-anywhere",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4a849e4fbee3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW — `assignment.mjs`'s file-header doc comment was not updated to mention the new domain-harness-seam wiring",
          "anchor": "low-assignmentmjss-file-header-doc-comment-was-not-updated-to-mention-the-new-domain-harness-seam-wiring",
          "githubAnchor": "low-assignmentmjss-file-header-doc-comment-was-not-updated-to-mention-the-new-domain-harness-seam-wiring",
          "stableAnchor": "h-cae5e8ee7b16"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Confirmed sound (no finding)",
          "anchor": "confirmed-sound-no-finding",
          "githubAnchor": "confirmed-sound-no-finding",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6e729676d302"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Disposition",
          "anchor": "disposition",
          "githubAnchor": "disposition",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0178178d6f83"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Fix Evidence",
          "anchor": "fix-evidence",
          "githubAnchor": "fix-evidence",
          "stableAnchor": "h-816fecdd8c4d"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Fix 1 (HIGH) — per-domain failure isolation in `DOMAIN_HARNESS_SEAMS` discovery",
          "anchor": "fix-1-high-per-domain-failure-isolation-in-domainharnessseams-discovery",
          "githubAnchor": "fix-1-high-per-domain-failure-isolation-in-domainharnessseams-discovery",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a96d275e01d3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Fix 2 (MEDIUM) — document the per-domain opt-in nature of the harness seam",
          "anchor": "fix-2-medium-document-the-per-domain-opt-in-nature-of-the-harness-seam",
          "githubAnchor": "fix-2-medium-document-the-per-domain-opt-in-nature-of-the-harness-seam",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a5c20184d40d"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Fix 3 (LOW) — update the file-header doc comment",
          "anchor": "fix-3-low-update-the-file-header-doc-comment",
          "githubAnchor": "fix-3-low-update-the-file-header-doc-comment",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c110921aea3e"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Combined test-suite verification",
          "anchor": "combined-test-suite-verification",
          "githubAnchor": "combined-test-suite-verification",
          "stableAnchor": "h-af8867a3fdca"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Coordinator Verification (Fix Round)",
          "anchor": "coordinator-verification-fix-round",
          "githubAnchor": "coordinator-verification-fix-round",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d74775e8c2d3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Red-Team",
          "anchor": "red-team",
          "githubAnchor": "red-team",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ea9377eadaae"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH — R2's non-driving guarantee has no defense inside `chooseStageOperation`/`interpretAssignmentRunResult` themselves; it lives entirely in one caller-side filter, and a real inline Assignment's real RunResult, fed through the public `lastRunResult` parameter, fully drives a Stage-edge advance",
          "anchor": "high-r2s-non-driving-guarantee-has-no-defense-inside-choosestageoperationinterpretassignmentrunresult-themselves-it-lives-entirely-in-one-caller-side-filter-and-a-real-inline-assignments-real-runresult-fed-through-the-public-lastrunresult-parameter-fully-drives-a-stage-edge-advance",
          "githubAnchor": "high-r2s-non-driving-guarantee-has-no-defense-inside-choosestageoperationinterpretassignmentrunresult-themselves-it-lives-entirely-in-one-caller-side-filter-and-a-real-inline-assignments-real-runresult-fed-through-the-public-lastrunresult-parameter-fully-drives-a-stage-edge-advance",
          "stableAnchor": "h-bbcbb8c8b89b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH — fields the domain harness seam is not supposed to touch (`role`, `objective`, `budget`, `capabilities`) are never re-validated after the seam runs; a buggy or adversarial harness can smuggle invalid values straight into the frozen, persisted Assignment",
          "anchor": "high-fields-the-domain-harness-seam-is-not-supposed-to-touch-role-objective-budget-capabilities-are-never-re-validated-after-the-seam-runs-a-buggy-or-adversarial-harness-can-smuggle-invalid-values-straight-into-the-frozen-persisted-assignment",
          "githubAnchor": "high-fields-the-domain-harness-seam-is-not-supposed-to-touch-role-objective-budget-capabilities-are-never-re-validated-after-the-seam-runs-a-buggy-or-adversarial-harness-can-smuggle-invalid-values-straight-into-the-frozen-persisted-assignment",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e32acb3a9eee"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW — the per-domain import-time isolation fixed in the Fix Round does not extend to a harness's `enrichAndValidateContract` throwing at *call* time; this is consistent with how `RunnerConfigError` already propagates from an intentional rejection, but is unstated and untested as its own category",
          "anchor": "low-the-per-domain-import-time-isolation-fixed-in-the-fix-round-does-not-extend-to-a-harnesss-enrichandvalidatecontract-throwing-at-call-time-this-is-consistent-with-how-runnerconfigerror-already-propagates-from-an-intentional-rejection-but-is-unstated-and-untested-as-its-own-category",
          "githubAnchor": "low-the-per-domain-import-time-isolation-fixed-in-the-fix-round-does-not-extend-to-a-harnesss-enrichandvalidatecontract-throwing-at-call-time-this-is-consistent-with-how-runnerconfigerror-already-propagates-from-an-intentional-rejection-but-is-unstated-and-untested-as-its-own-category",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a6ec38b1dbb2"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Confirmed sound (no finding)",
          "anchor": "confirmed-sound-no-finding-1",
          "githubAnchor": "confirmed-sound-no-finding-1",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b5cdca78f7ab"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Disposition (Red-Team Round)",
          "anchor": "disposition-red-team-round",
          "githubAnchor": "disposition-red-team-round",
