          "stableAnchor": "h-4cafcd7f5cd1"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-1 — the silent-discard guard could not fire on a FAN-OUT taskKey collision (two different bindings, not just one)",
          "anchor": "medium-1-the-silent-discard-guard-could-not-fire-on-a-fan-out-taskkey-collision-two-different-bindings-not-just-one",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-1-the-silent-discard-guard-could-not-fire-on-a-fan-out-taskkey-collision-two-different-bindings-not-just-one",
          "stableAnchor": "h-dda0634e4dc4"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-2 — MED-4's segment scan checked a `coord_` naming CONVENTION, not disk existence, so a plainly-named real foreign session slipped through",
          "anchor": "medium-2-med-4s-segment-scan-checked-a-coord-naming-convention-not-disk-existence-so-a-plainly-named-real-foreign-session-slipped-through",
