          "stableAnchor": "h-529b799b78a5"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "The immutability pin is the settle-report sha256, and staleness is real",
          "anchor": "the-immutability-pin-is-the-settle-report-sha256-and-staleness-is-real",
          "githubAnchor": "the-immutability-pin-is-the-settle-report-sha256-and-staleness-is-real",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5c8f1b6211cc"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
