          "anchor": "1-attacks-that-failed-the-classification-survives",
          "githubAnchor": "1-attacks-that-failed-the-classification-survives",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b101eb20e18a"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1a. Can the pack-gate path reach `linkSessionContribution` with a shape its P08.2/P08.3 proof never covered? NO.",
          "anchor": "1a-can-the-pack-gate-path-reach-linksessioncontribution-with-a-shape-its-p082p083-proof-never-covered-no",
          "githubAnchor": "1a-can-the-pack-gate-path-reach-linksessioncontribution-with-a-shape-its-p082p083-proof-never-covered-no",
          "stableAnchor": "h-449344037052"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1b. `linkedBy` forgery — five angles, all refused, at TWO independent layers",
          "anchor": "1b-linkedby-forgery-five-angles-all-refused-at-two-independent-layers",
          "githubAnchor": "1b-linkedby-forgery-five-angles-all-refused-at-two-independent-layers",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5cbf8e4330be"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1c. `resolveRef`/`assignmentId` — no asymmetry vs `authorize`/`disposition`",
          "anchor": "1c-resolverefassignmentid-no-asymmetry-vs-authorizedisposition",
          "githubAnchor": "1c-resolverefassignmentid-no-asymmetry-vs-authorizedisposition",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b1c0048f1697"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1d. Unguarded `loadCoordinationProtocol` left in `run.mjs`? NO — exactly two, both guarded",
          "anchor": "1d-unguarded-loadcoordinationprotocol-left-in-runmjs-no-exactly-two-both-guarded",
          "githubAnchor": "1d-unguarded-loadcoordinationprotocol-left-in-runmjs-no-exactly-two-both-guarded",
          "stableAnchor": "h-202bbe4c3c80"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1e. The \"a naive test cannot isolate `aggregationCloseParams`\" claim — TRUE, verified",
          "anchor": "1e-the-a-naive-test-cannot-isolate-aggregationcloseparams-claim-true-verified",
          "githubAnchor": "1e-the-a-naive-test-cannot-isolate-aggregationcloseparams-claim-true-verified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-52d3693a7a9e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. Findings",
          "anchor": "2-findings",
          "githubAnchor": "2-findings",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f0b9fdc6db3c"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "M1 — MEDIUM (introduced by this cell): both new catches discard the original error, and the request-boundary one actively misattributes",
          "anchor": "m1-medium-introduced-by-this-cell-both-new-catches-discard-the-original-error-and-the-request-boundary-one-actively-misattributes",
          "githubAnchor": "m1-medium-introduced-by-this-cell-both-new-catches-discard-the-original-error-and-the-request-boundary-one-actively-misattributes",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c75434a1e5d7"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "M2 — MEDIUM (pre-existing, unnamed, and now load-bearing): the base door does not cross-check a resumed session's protocol; the pack gate does",
          "anchor": "m2-medium-pre-existing-unnamed-and-now-load-bearing-the-base-door-does-not-cross-check-a-resumed-sessions-protocol-the-pack-gate-does",
          "githubAnchor": "m2-medium-pre-existing-unnamed-and-now-load-bearing-the-base-door-does-not-cross-check-a-resumed-sessions-protocol-the-pack-gate-does",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7e15317a2f21"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "M3 — MEDIUM (factual correction to §1d/§1c item #5): the definition-pinning gap IS worsened by Phase 10's own work — proven, not argued",
          "anchor": "m3-medium-factual-correction-to-1d1c-item-5-the-definition-pinning-gap-is-worsened-by-phase-10s-own-work-proven-not-argued",
          "githubAnchor": "m3-medium-factual-correction-to-1d1c-item-5-the-definition-pinning-gap-is-worsened-by-phase-10s-own-work-proven-not-argued",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9c93b190a1e3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "L1 — LOW (introduced by this cell): `anchors: []` vs omitted breaks idempotent repeat",
          "anchor": "l1-low-introduced-by-this-cell-anchors-vs-omitted-breaks-idempotent-repeat",
          "githubAnchor": "l1-low-introduced-by-this-cell-anchors-vs-omitted-breaks-idempotent-repeat",
          "stableAnchor": "h-071bc5bb8af1"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "L2 — LOW (pre-existing, newly user-facing): wrong field name in a contribution-link refusal",
          "anchor": "l2-low-pre-existing-newly-user-facing-wrong-field-name-in-a-contribution-link-refusal",
          "githubAnchor": "l2-low-pre-existing-newly-user-facing-wrong-field-name-in-a-contribution-link-refusal",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f1783c3b26ae"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Test-quality review of the UPDATED tests",
          "anchor": "3-test-quality-review-of-the-updated-tests",
          "githubAnchor": "3-test-quality-review-of-the-updated-tests",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0d4e22cb2eaa"
